WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,060 --> 00:00:07,500
put down what you are holding

2
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,700
Otherwise, the hair will be worn through

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,860
But it’s not just your clothes

4
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,970
Xia Shining

5
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:13,250
why are you here

6
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:18,530
I should ask you, Su Weiwei, the last time you hid salt secretly

7
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:19,530
Already given you a chance

8
00:00:19,530 --> 00:00:21,770
What are you going to do with this jar of salt this time?

9
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:23,130
I had the credit for moving the rocks.

10
00:00:23,130 --> 00:00:24,890
It’s a centimeter gift that can move rocks.

11
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:26,530
The salt in the jar belongs to someone else

12
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:29,580
You went to Xipo

13
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:30,820
So you steal salt

14
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:33,220
I also want to give myself a backup plan to stop talking nonsense.

15
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:46,220
I've already returned the salt to you for what happened last night

16
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:50,560
Teacher Jiang came over early in the morning and said that if you want to be punished, you can hold a meeting.

17
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,160
According to the rules set by the three parties

18
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:53,520
Steal salt and double the price

19
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:54,720
This account is in your name

20
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:57,280
Use centimeters to deduct three months. I told you before.

21
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,600
His thoughts were not on Zhengdao.

22
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:01,270
Say two less words and add one more from today on

23
00:01:01,270 --> 00:01:03,670
You move to the stone crevice area next to the warehouse and open salt for everyone.

24
00:01:03,950 --> 00:01:07,350
You guys let me open the salt and keep the things you have touched by yourself. One less thing.

25
00:01:07,350 --> 00:01:09,310
If the centimeter is doubled, the line will be deducted

26
00:01:19,330 --> 00:01:20,490
I will bring you food as usual

27
00:01:20,810 --> 00:01:24,880
Sister Weiwei

28
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:40,640
What's wrong? Su Weiwei. It's really Zuo Si. Look at the footprints. She went to the Western Slope. Is she crazy? There are wild boars there. What should I do? Miss Chen can't chase her at night. Isn't it safe? Wait until dawn.
